# EmberHeart / Nethunter fragment — INTENTIONALLY EMPTY (boot-safe).
#
# OP15's base kernel already provides USB gadget/HID + cfg80211/mac80211.
# Every config we tried adding here reassigned or perturbed a base symbol and
# bootlooped the device (RFKILL override, then the USB-gadget/netfilter block).
# So we add NOTHING to the kernel: the injection .ko are shipped in the zip and
# link against the DEVICE cfg80211 CRCs (device_wifi.symvers). Re-introduce
# individual configs ONLY after confirming via pstore they don't break boot.
